# Environment

This project runs on Windows using PowerShell.

IMPORTANT:
- Do NOT use Unix-only commands such as head, tail, grep, sed, awk, cat, rm, cp or mv.
- Prefer PowerShell commands.
- Use Get-ChildItem, Select-Object -First, Select-String and Get-Content.
- Do not assume bash, zsh or GNU utilities are installed.
- Always use Windows-compatible commands.

# Project rules

- Analyze existing files before modifying them.
- Reuse existing Playwright, n8n and PostgreSQL implementations.
- Do not rebuild the project from scratch.
- Do not delete existing functionality.
- Do not delete databases or Docker volumes.
- Do not modify secrets or credentials.
- LinkedIn is the labor source.
- Playwright is the scraper.
- n8n is the orchestrator.
- PostgreSQL is used for persistence and deduplication.
- Telegram is the final notification channel.
- Do NOT introduce LinkedIn RSS.
- Do NOT introduce InfoJobs.